teachingContent.beginner:
**CRUD** = Create, Read, Update, Delete

**Create (Insert):**
```javascript
// Insert one
await users.insertOne({
  name: 'John',
  age: 25
});

// Insert many
await users.insertMany([
  { name: 'John', age: 25 },
  { name: 'Jane', age: 30 }
]);
```

**Read (Find):**
```javascript
// Find all
const allUsers = await users.find().toArray();

// Find one
const user = await users.findOne({ name: 'John' });
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Advanced CRUD operations:

**Update:**
```javascript
// Update one
await users.updateOne(
  { name: 'John' },
  { $set: { age: 26 } }
);

// Update many
await users.updateMany(
  { age: { $lt: 18 } },
  { $set: { minor: true } }
);
```

**Delete:**
```javascript
// Delete one
await users.deleteOne({ name: 'John' });

// Delete many
await users.deleteMany({ age: { $lt: 18 } });
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Complex queries and operations:

**Upsert:**
```javascript
await users.updateOne(
  { email: 'john@example.com' },
  { $set: { name: 'John', age: 25 } },
  { upsert: true }
);
```

**Bulk Operations:**
```javascript
await users.bulkWrite([
  { insertOne: { document: { name: 'John' } } },
  { updateOne: { filter: { name: 'Jane' }, update: { $set: { age: 31 } } } }
]);
```

teachingContent.beginner:
**Query operators** let you filter data.

**Comparison:**
```javascript
// Greater than
await users.find({ age: { $gt: 18 } });

// Less than or equal
await users.find({ age: { $lte: 65 } });

// Not equal
await users.find({ status: { $ne: 'inactive' } });
```

**Logical:**
```javascript
// AND
await users.find({
  age: { $gte: 18 },
  status: 'active'
});

// OR
await users.find({
  $or: [
    { age: { $lt: 18 } },
    { age: { $gt: 65 } }
  ]
});
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Advanced query operators:

**Array Operators:**
```javascript
// In array
await users.find({ role: { $in: ['admin', 'moderator'] } });

// Array contains
await users.find({ tags: 'javascript' });

// Array size
await users.find({ tags: { $size: 3 } });
```

**Element Operators:**
```javascript
// Field exists
await users.find({ email: { $exists: true } });

// Type check
await users.find({ age: { $type: 'number' } });
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Complex queries:

**Regex:**
```javascript
await users.find({
  email: { $regex: /@gmail\.com$/ }
});
```

**Nested Documents:**
```javascript
await users.find({
  'address.city': 'New York'
});
```

teachingContent.beginner:
**Aggregation** processes data through stages.

**Basic Pipeline:**
```javascript
await users.aggregate([
  { $match: { age: { $gte: 18 } } },
  { $group: {
    _id: '$city',
    count: { $sum: 1 }
  }}
]);
```

**Common Stages:**
- `$match`: Filter documents
- `$group`: Group by field
- `$sort`: Sort results
- `$limit`: Limit results

teachingContent.intermediate:
Aggregation pipeline stages:

**$project:**
```javascript
{ $project: {
  name: 1,
  age: 1,
  isAdult: { $gte: ['$age', 18] }
}}
```

**$lookup (Join):**
```javascript
{ $lookup: {
  from: 'orders',
  localField: '_id',
  foreignField: 'userId',
  as: 'orders'
}}
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Advanced aggregation:

**$facet:**
```javascript
{ $facet: {
  byAge: [
    { $group: { _id: '$age', count: { $sum: 1 } } }
  ],
  byCity: [
    { $group: { _id: '$city', count: { $sum: 1 } } }
  ]
}}
```

teachingContent.beginner:
**Indexes** make queries faster!

**Create Index:**
```javascript
// Single field
await users.createIndex({ email: 1 });

// Compound index
await users.createIndex({ city: 1, age: -1 });
```

**Why Indexes?**
- Without index: Scans all documents
- With index: Jumps directly to data
- Like a book's index!

teachingContent.intermediate:
Index types and usage:

**Unique Index:**
```javascript
await users.createIndex(
  { email: 1 },
  { unique: true }
);
```

**Text Index:**
```javascript
await users.createIndex({ bio: 'text' });

// Search
await users.find({ $text: { $search: 'developer' } });
```
